# Test locally, then deploy

After UI, product, or app changes:

1. Verify on local `http://127.0.0.1:3000` first. Exercise the changed flow in the browser. A screenshot is not enough.
2. Only after local testing passes: commit, push `HEAD` to `origin/main`, and deploy Railway production (`railway up` if GitHub autodeploy does not start).
3. Confirm the live site at `https://chapterkin-production.up.railway.app` (and `www.chapterkin.com` once DNS is live). Watch Railway logs for migrate/schema errors.
4. Do not leave working product changes sitting only on local.
